    "reuse": "Single runpy call to unchanged761a9f viewer; observes fine24states using geometry and nodal pure functions, then CSV/JSON-only coarse/fine comparison. Coarse observer0. No copy of raw viewer or mechanics.",
    "existing_validity_gates": "Raw viewer checks source origins and only allowed hf_eval pure module set; result/model/state canonical descriptors, declared archive fields, fixed-body zero arrays, geometry validity, cached body force sums, per-node holding opposition, GIF coverage and unchanged input pins. No earlier source or physical gate changed.",
