    "mechanical_zero_basis": "Static pinned pure import closure and saved-array/scalar derivations. No dynamic mechanics hooks; no new CLI/API/model/force/tangent/solver/HP/JIT/LF entry invoked. Static review is not runtime mechanical instrumentation or a numerical execution.",
    "physics": "signed lower Fy/material/Hu separated; 2|Fy| magnitude distinct fullnet and holding opposite. Finite segment distances unsigned, rays geometric. Free-medium mask excludes solid and fixed workpiece. solid/medium Gauss minima separated from global production min; peak J color uses cell mean, Hu color flattened Frobenius norm; comparison Hu is max absolute component. Green principal strain from saved F only.",
    "log_and_numeric_scope": "New free-medium minJ axis log with strictly positive saved metric requirement. No force/J/Hu data clipping or zeroing. Old point_segment np.clip bounds the finite-segment projection parameter by definition, not physical data values.",
    "resources": "One whole-helper600s from before imports, outer660s, sampled own/treeRSS8GiB. Worker checks before/after raw viewer, comparison panels, input hashes and final output hashes; late error marks phase failed and raises. Launcher cooperative stop file, no force/retry/extension; existing underlying synchronized calls only check on return. Sampling is not an OS hard resource guarantee.",
    "evidence_write": "Original raw view.json retained; separate phase_view.json describes new comparison with own outputs/pins and static-zero provenance; original production response not written or mutated.",
    "qualification": "saved production diagnostics/two-grid sensitivity only. No HP, pressure, effective-clamp, convergence or HF5 grant; original independent response flags preserved; old coarse reference/visual qualifications not transferred."
